{"id":"en_the-god-s-descent","title":"The God's Descent","titleEn":"The God's Descent","description":"Cast out by the influential Zhan family, Zhan Tianchen earned his standing through years of combat at the border, rising at last to be hailed as the God-King of the Northern Frontier. His in-laws, however, failed to recognize what he had become and, as their own influence expanded, chose to sever the marriage. Surrounded by the scorn of the nobility and the threatening presence of King Poseidon, he must keep his identity hidden while bringing the latter's invasion plan to light. Through cleverness and resolve, he defeats the plot and preserves the peace of the realm. By the time it is over, neither his former wife's family nor the Zhans can undo their regrets. Zhan Tianchen remains at the summit, untroubled by what they feel, his deeds passing into legend as he journeys on in search of his","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-gods-descent/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-gods-descent/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Hidden Identity","Love After Marriage","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dip86/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-god-s-descent_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dip86/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-god-s-descent_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dip86/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-god-s-descent_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dip86/?pub=4occak","kind":"emb